{"a":[126,126],"h":"<p>126.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"66\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 65.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 32.3 32.3 41.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 41.3 49.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve bu ya'ni islâm, inşirahı sadr ile hakka ittiba' ve inkıyad<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"178\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 178.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 32.3 39.0 39.0 45.8 52.6 64.6 64.6 80.3 96.8 96.8 96.8 103.6 120.8 120.8 134.3 141.0 148.6 148.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.8 52.6 80.3 103.6 141.0 162.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> rabbının dosdoğru, eğilmez bükülmez caddesidir. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"257\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 257.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 35.2 35.2 42.7 42.7 54.0 54.0 63.0 78.7 78.7 85.4 85.4 93.7 100.4 100.4 117.0 117.0 133.4 140.2 147.0 147.0 151.4 159.0 174.7 181.4 188.2 188.2 195.0 195.0 209.2 225.0 225.0 234.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 42.7 54.0 63.0 93.7 140.2 181.4 195.0 209.2 234.0 240.7\" y=\"25.6 20.3 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> artık tezekkür edecek, düşünüb anlıyacak olanlar için bu yolun bütün alâmetlerini, nişanlarını belliklerini Kur'anda şüphesiz tafsıl ve beyan ettik. 127. </p>"}